OL,3,GNEWSAFamily pay tribute to 'much-loved'
OL,4,Adad who died after being hit by car
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a PE teacher who died
OL,7,Fafter he was hit by a car in Fife have
OL,8,Fpaid tribute to their "much-loved"
OL,9,Ffamily member.
OL,11,FDaren Baillie, 51, was pronounced dead
OL,12,Fat the scene of the incident, which
OL,13,Fhappened on the A92 at Freuchie, at
OL,14,Fabout 23:50 on Thursday and involved a
OL,15,Fred Suzuki Swift.
OL,17,FThe female driver of the Suzuki was
OL,18,Funinjured. Inquiries are ongoing to
OL,19,Festablish the full circumstances of the
OL,20,Fincident, police confirmed.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
