OL,3,GNEWSAFamily pay tribute to 'much-loved'
OL,4,Adad who died after being hit by car
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement released through police,
OL,7,FDaren's family said they were
OL,8,Fdevastated by his "tragic death" and
OL,9,Fwished to express their gratitude for
OL,10,Fthe support they had received.
